# InfinityX Android 17 — Initial Lexus Release

## 📱 Device & Device Tree

* Updated the OnePlus Nord 5 (`lexus`) device tree for the InfinityX Android 17 base.
* Updated device configuration and platform dependencies for the SM8650 common tree.
* Updated device information and model configuration.
* Set the target screen density to **530 DPI**.
* Updated device overlays and RRO configuration.
* Updated the punch-hole display overlay configuration.
* Added Android 17 Treble labeling tracking support.
* Updated SELinux device policy for Android 17 platform labeling requirements.
* Cleaned up legacy device configuration and overlays.
* Updated device sources and vendor configuration from the latest available device base.

## 🖥️ Display & Refresh Rate

* Added refresh-rate switching timers.
* Improved minimum and peak refresh-rate configuration.
* Relocated peak and minimum refresh-rate configuration to the Lineage overlay.
* Set the default game refresh rate to **144 Hz**.
* Updated display-related Oplus interfaces.
* De-blobbed **Oplus DisplayColorFeature V1**.
* Added explicit build support for the DisplayColorFeature V1 NDK interface.
* De-blobbed the **Oplus MixLut3D V1** display interface.
* Updated display overlays for the Nord 5 punch-hole panel.
* Enabled `debug.sf.auto_latch_unsignaled` for improved SurfaceFlinger behavior.
* Updated graphics common HAL dependencies to **V7**.

## 🚀 Performance & Responsiveness

* Updated graphics and display configuration for Android 17.
* Refined SurfaceFlinger display behavior.
* Updated Soong configuration variables required by the current source base.
* Improved vendor library compatibility with the SM8650 platform.
* Added required **APS Turbo** libraries to the public vendor libraries list.
* Updated platform dependencies for the current Android 17 device configuration.
* Refined device-specific performance and display configuration.

## 📳 Haptics & Vibration

* Switched the device to the **LiveTap vibrator HAL**.
* Updated device configuration for the LiveTap haptic implementation.
* Improved compatibility with the current Android 17 vibrator framework.

## 📶 Connectivity & Telephony

* Enabled **VoNR** support.
* Added carrier configuration for **VoNR on Jio**.
* Updated telephony and carrier configuration for the SM8650 common platform.
* Updated vendor configuration required for the current connectivity stack.

## 🧩 Oplus Hardware

* Updated Oplus hardware interface handling.
* De-blobbed selected Oplus hardware interfaces.
* Updated Oplus display-related HAL configuration.
* Added required compatibility configuration for Oplus hardware interfaces.
* Updated vendor-side hardware dependencies for Android 17.
* Updated compatibility handling for the current SM8650 common device tree.

## 📦 Vendor & Blobs

* Updated vendor configuration for the OnePlus Nord 5.
* Updated OOS vendor sources and required proprietary blobs.
* Added **APS Turbo** libraries to `vendor.public.libraries.txt`.
* Updated vendor dependencies for the SM8650 platform.
* Updated Soong configuration for the current vendor layout.
* Cleaned up obsolete vendor and device configuration.
* Updated proprietary library compatibility for Android 17.

## 🛡️ SELinux & Security

* Added Android 17 Treble labeling tracking.
* Updated SELinux device policy for Android 17 platform labeling requirements.
* Updated device/vendor policy compatibility.
* Cleaned up legacy policy configuration.
* Updated platform/vendor labeling required by the Android 17 framework.
* Improved compatibility with the current Android 17 SELinux policy structure.

## 🛠️ Build System & Compatibility

* Updated the device tree for the current InfinityX Android 17 source layout.
* Updated Soong namespaces and configuration for the current source base.
* Updated Soong configuration variables to the correct boolean types.
* Updated graphics common HAL dependencies.
* Cleaned up legacy device configuration.
* Updated common device dependencies for Android 17.
* Updated vendor compatibility configuration.
* Removed obsolete device configuration and legacy overlay handling.
* Updated build dependencies required by the current SM8650 platform.

## 📱 Device Configuration

* Updated the device model information used by Settings.
* Updated display density configuration to **530 DPI**.
* Updated refresh-rate overlays.
* Updated punch-hole display configuration.
* Updated device-specific RRO configuration.
* Updated common SM8650 device dependencies.
* Refined the overall device configuration for Android 17.

## ⚡ Power & System

* Updated device-specific system configuration.
* Refined display and refresh-rate behavior for power efficiency.
* Updated vendor configuration for the current Android 17 platform.
* Updated platform dependencies required by the SM8650 common tree.
* Cleaned up obsolete configuration inherited from previous device revisions.

## 📱 Overall

This is the initial **InfinityX Android 17** release for the **OnePlus Nord 5 (lexus)**.

The update brings a refreshed device tree and SM8650 common configuration for Android 17, with improvements across display handling, refresh-rate management, Oplus hardware interfaces, haptics, connectivity, vendor compatibility and SELinux integration.

The device now includes **LiveTap vibrator HAL support, 144 Hz game refresh-rate configuration, refresh-rate switching timers, 530 DPI configuration, VoNR support, APS Turbo libraries, updated Oplus display interfaces and Android 17 Treble labeling support**.

The display stack has also been updated with refreshed Oplus display interfaces, MixLut3D and DisplayColorFeature handling, improved SurfaceFlinger configuration and updated refresh-rate overlays.

This build is provided as an **UNOFFICIAL InfinityX Android 17 build** for the OnePlus Nord 5 (`lexus`).

## 📌 Device Information

* **Device:** OnePlus Nord 5
* **Codename:** `lexus`
* **SoC:** Snapdragon 8s Gen 3
* **Platform:** SM8650 common
* **Android:** 17
* **ROM:** InfinityX
